Example::

    >>> a = torch.randn(4).uniform_(1, 2)
    >>> a
    tensor([ 1.3192, 1.9915, 1.9674, 1.7151 ])
    >>> torch.acosh(a)
    tensor([ 0.7791, 1.3120, 1.2979, 1.1341 ])

